the weather is going to be beautiful  this saturday morning for you to come  out and support a very special  fundraiser for children in our area with  rare diseases it's the vegas cares about  rare fundraiser it's in person this year  after a virtual run walk last year  this is going to be our sixth annual  vegas cares about rare 5k one mile  charity event this saturday's walk run  is one of the largest fundraising events  that supports the non-profit little miss  hannah foundation created in honor of  robert and kerry austria's youngest  daughter hannah who was born with an  ultra rare genetic disease that disease  has no cure and no effective treatment  so the time that we were with her for  three and a half years  it was all dedicated to making sure that  her quality of life was maintained was  the best it could be the couple created  the little miss hannah foundation to  help other families who are also caring  for kids with medically fragile  conditions rare diseases or in hospice  or palliative care fronts from this  weekend's event go to various grants  even medical equipment not covered by  insurance to help these other southern  nevada families it's amazing i'm still  getting a lot of facebook memories you  know from years past and you see the  pictures over the last couple of years  around this time and it's amazing that  it's you know this is our sixth annuals  our tenth year uh the support from  southern nevada has been you know  exceeded expectations for sure and each  year they give special attention to the  children with medically complex  conditions in our community as vips this  year 25 very important people will be in  attendance executive director and mother  to vip bradley jenny kershaw our kids  are treated like celebrities i say it  every year but there's no other event  like this  where  people you know family friends people  you don't know they're cheering you on  they're encouraging your child it's  nothing but love and just support and  encouragement and i'm getting goosebumps  right now just talking about it it  really really is and it's an amazing  event  it is and i'm so honored once again to  be the mc and kick things off for this  weekend's walk and run so come on out  join us this saturday morning at  cornerstone park in henderson the race  starts at 8 30. you can register online  go to vegascares.org  or just come register in person early  saturday morning before the race
 

